<li>Codex Sinaiticus (~330-360 M)</li>
<li>Codex Alexandrinus (~400-440 M)</li>
<li>Codex Freerianus (~450 M; hanya tersisa ayat 1-2.9-11.17-19)</li>
<li>Uncial 061 (~ 450 M; hanya tersisa ayat 2-8)</li>
<li>Codex Claromontanus (~550 M)</li>
<li>Codex Coislinianus (~ 550 M; hanya tersisa ayat 9-13)</li>
</ul>
